#
.. vinyl_vsc_begin:: cachetag
	:oneliner:	Cachetag purge-map counters
	:order:		70

	Counters for cachetag purge history, volatile membership, and Fellow-direct persistence.

.. vinyl_vsc:: index_memory_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Total VMOD index memory bytes

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_side_table_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership side-table bytes

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_side_table_buckets
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership side-table buckets

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_side_table_grows
	:type:	counter
	:level:	debug
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership side-table growth operations

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_side_table_shrinks
	:type:	counter
	:level:	debug
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership side-table shrink operations

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_object_table_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership object-vector bytes

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_object_count_sidecar_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Volatile membership object-count sidecar bytes

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_object_count_overflow_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Live overflow membership metadata bytes

	Bytes used to encode memberships with 255 or more folds. Direct-vector
	builds count one 8-byte header per live overflow object; set-interning
	builds count one 32-byte node header per live unique overflow set.

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_sets
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Live unique interned membership sets

	Distinct multi-fold membership sets currently interned in the process-local
	hash-consed registry. Zero when set interning is disabled.

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_set_refs
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Live object references to interned membership sets

	Total live multi-tag objects referencing an interned membership set, summed
	across all interned sets. Zero when set interning is disabled.

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_set_hits
	:type:	counter
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Attaches reusing an interned membership set

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_set_misses
	:type:	counter
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Attaches creating an interned membership set

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_set_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Interned membership-set node bytes

	Bytes held by interned-set nodes: a 32-byte header plus 8 bytes per fold,
	summed across all live interned sets. Zero when set interning is disabled.

.. vinyl_vsc:: volatile_interned_table_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Interning hash-table bucket-array bytes

